<p>The <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">Source</code>/<code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">Timer</code>/<code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">Observer</code> mentioned above are collectively called <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">__mode item__</code>. An <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">item</code> can be added to multiple <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">mode</code>s at the same time. However, adding an <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">item</code> to the same <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">mode</code> repeatedly has no effect. If a <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">mode</code> doesn’t have any <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">item</code>, the <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">RunLoop</code> will exit directly without entering the loop.</p>

